# Complete UI/UX Redesign — Private Video Player

## Project Objective

Perform a comprehensive UI/UX redesign of my existing Private Video Player application.

The goal is to transform the current application into a premium, modern, minimal, responsive, privacy-focused media player and personal video vault.

The experience should combine:

- The polished playback experience of premium media players.
- The clean organization of modern media libraries.
- The privacy-first design of a secure digital vault.
- The responsiveness and usability of a high-quality mobile application.

This is not a request to build a new application from scratch. Work with the existing repository, architecture, components, APIs, authentication system, streaming infrastructure, and storage integrations.

The redesign must cover the complete application, including:

1. Video watch page.
2. Video player and playback controls.
3. Playback settings and menus.
4. Video library and dashboard.
5. Video cards.
6. Google Drive library.
7. Google Drive video watch page.
8. Intelligent Google Drive player selection and fallback.
9. Mobile and tablet responsiveness.
10. Privacy-related UI/UX.
11. Loading, buffering, error and empty states.
12. Navigation and overall application consistency.

